The above code eventually becomes the following when sending to the API:

```json
"6": {
 "inputs": {
 "text": "beautiful scenery nature glass bottle landscape, , purple galaxy bottle,",
 "clip": [
 "4",
 1
 ]
 },
 "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode"
 },
```

I propose that the input widget names are added to the exported JSON files to help build API calls.
